# Optional public form endpoint that accepts POST requests as JSON.
# Works with Formspree, Basin, Getform, or your own API route.
# The inquiry payload includes kind, name, business, email, phone, service,
# budget, timeline, description, contactMethod, conditional service details
# and the formatted "message" text.
#
# Leave empty to use the built-in email / WhatsApp handoff instead.
# Only put a public form endpoint here. Never add API secrets to a VITE_ variable.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
